+            errors (str, optional): Text error handling, for text modes. Defaults to None.
+            newline (str, optional): Text newline handling, for text modes. Defaults to None.
+            total (float, optional): Total size in bytes. Defaults to the size of the file.
+            task_id (TaskID, optional): Existing task to advance. Default is a new task.
